<title>HONG KONG: S&amp;P assigns PI ratings to five Taiwan banks.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns PI ratings to five Taiwan banks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Tuesday it had assigned the following Public Information Ratings to five Taiwanese banks -</p>
<p> RATING		   BANK</p>
<p>   A-PI     Taiwan Cooperative Bank Ltd</p>
<p> BBB-PI     Chang Hwa Commercial Bank Ltd</p>
<p> BBB-PI     First Commercial Bank Ltd</p>
<p> BBB-PI     Hua Nan Commercial Bank Ltd</p>
<p> BBB-PI     United World Chinese Commercial Bank Ltd</p>
<p>Public information ratings, a new service started by S&amp;P last year, are based on publicly disclosed information and do not rely on S&amp;P receiving access to the rated banks' management.</p>
</text>
